# Built by the workflow, never committed.
/devp2p
/.core-geth/

# Signing keys never enter this repository. The private half lives only in the
# DNS_SIGNING_KEY secret; losing it means every client that shipped its public
# half must be rebuilt.
*.key
*.pem

# Machine-local working notes, never published.
.local/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent configuration -- added with AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md, 2026-08-31.
# Everything above this line belongs to the publishing pipeline.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md are TRACKED and travel to every clone. Machine-local
# instructions go here instead, and must never be committed.
CLAUDE.local.md

# .claude/ is tracked so repo-local agent config reaches a clone. Only local and
# agent-written state is held back, and that deny-list lives in .claude/.gitignore
# beside the directory it governs.

# Ad-hoc planning and session notes, in whatever form they arrive.
# (.local/ is already covered above, by the pipeline block.)
SESSION_NOTES.md
PLANNING.md
SCRATCH.md
*.scratch.*
*.draft.*

# Credentials and key material beyond the *.key / *.pem above. The tree-signing
# key is an Ethereum KEYSTORE JSON, so the keystore patterns are not decorative.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
credentials.json
service-account.json
secrets/
keystore/
*.keystore
wallet.json
mnemonic.txt

# OS and editor droppings.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/settings.json
